PE 883: Remarkable Harmonic Triangles / 显著调和三角形

=== Definition ===
A harmonic triangle has integer sides a ≤ b ≤ c
where 1/a, 1/b, 1/c form an arithmetic progression.
Equivalently: 2/b = 1/a + 1/c, i.e., b = 2ac/(a+c).

